#. gettext picks its catalogue up once, before any of this
#. window exists, so a new language has to wait for a restart.
#: src/ui/window.vala:146
msgid "The new language will be used the next time Awalé is started."
msgstr "Die neue Sprache wird beim nächsten Start von Awalé verwendet."

#: src/ui/window.vala:358
msgid "That house belongs to the computer."
msgstr "Diese Mulde gehört dem Computer."

#: src/ui/window.vala:361
msgid "That house is empty."
msgstr "Diese Mulde ist leer."

#: src/ui/window.vala:364
msgid ""
"The computer has no seeds left, so you must play a house whose seeds reach "
"their row."
msgstr ""
"Der Computer hat keine Bohnen mehr, deshalb musst du eine Mulde spielen, "
"deren Bohnen seine Reihe erreichen."

#: src/ui/window.vala:367
msgid ""
"That move would capture every seed the computer has left, which the rules do "
"not allow."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Zug würde alle verbliebenen Bohnen des Computers erobern, was die "
"Regeln nicht erlauben."

#: src/ui/window.vala:413 src/ui/window.vala:554
msgid "The computer is thinking…"
msgstr "Der Computer denkt nach…"

#. / Said when the computer has chosen its move and is about to play
#. / it. %d is the computer's house, numbered 1 to 6 along its row.
#: src/ui/window.vala:428
#, c-format
msgid "The computer plays house %d."
msgstr "Der Computer spielt Mulde %d."

#: src/ui/window.vala:552
msgid "Your turn."
msgstr "Du bist am Zug."

#. / Learning mode hint. %1$d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#. / %2$d is how many seeds it captures.
#: src/ui/window.vala:619
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %1$d: it captures %2$d seed."
msgid_plural "Play house %1$d: it captures %2$d seeds."
msgstr[0] "Spiele Mulde %1$d: sie erobert %2$d Bohne."
msgstr[1] "Spiele Mulde %1$d: sie erobert %2$d Bohnen."

#. / Learning mode hint. %1$d is the recommended house and
#. / %2$d one of your own houses, both numbered 1 to 6.
#. / %3$d is how many seeds it keeps out of reach.
#: src/ui/window.vala:626
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your house %2$d open to a capture of %3$d "
"seed."
msgid_plural ""
"Play house %1$d: it avoids leaving your house %2$d open to a capture of %3$d "
"seeds."
msgstr[0] ""
"Spiele Mulde %1$d: so bleibt deine Mulde %2$d nicht offen für eine Eroberung "
"von %3$d Bohne."
msgstr[1] ""
"Spiele Mulde %1$d: so bleibt deine Mulde %2$d nicht offen für eine Eroberung "
"von %3$d Bohnen."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:631
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Play house %d: the computer is out of seeds and this feeds them, which the "
"rules require."
msgstr ""
"Spiele Mulde %d: der Computer hat keine Bohnen mehr und dieser Zug versorgt "
"ihn, wie es die Regeln verlangen."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:634
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %d: it is your only legal move."
msgstr "Spiele Mulde %d: es ist dein einziger gültiger Zug."

#. / Learning mode hint. %d is the recommended house, 1 to 6.
#: src/ui/window.vala:637
#, c-format
msgid "Play house %d: it leaves you the strongest position."
msgstr "Spiele Mulde %d: sie lässt dir die beste Stellung."

#. / Shown once the player has reached 25 seeds while the round
#. / is still being played. %1$d is their seeds, %2$d the computer's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:670
#, c-format
msgid "You have won, %1$d seeds to %2$d. You can still finish the round."
msgstr ""
"Du hast gewonnen, %1$d Bohnen zu %2$d. Du kannst die Runde trotzdem zu Ende "
"spielen."

#. / Shown once the computer has reached 25 seeds while the round is
#. / still being played. %1$d is the computer's seeds, %2$d the player's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:674
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The computer has won, %1$d seeds to %2$d. You can still finish the round."
msgstr ""
"Der Computer hat gewonnen, %1$d Bohnen zu %2$d. Du kannst die Runde trotzdem "
"zu Ende spielen."

#. / Final result. %d is the number of seeds each player collected.
#: src/ui/window.vala:685
#, c-format
msgid "A draw, %d seeds each."
msgstr "Unentschieden, %d Bohnen für jeden."

#. / Final result. %1$d is the player's seeds, %2$d the computer's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:690
#, c-format
msgid "You win, %1$d seeds to %2$d."
msgstr "Du gewinnst, %1$d Bohnen zu %2$d."

#. / Final result. %1$d is the computer's seeds, %2$d the player's.
#: src/ui/window.vala:693
#, c-format
msgid "The computer wins, %1$d seeds to %2$d."
msgstr "Der Computer gewinnt, %1$d Bohnen zu %2$d."

#: src/ui/window.vala:702
msgid ""
"The same position came up three times, so each player took the seeds in "
"their own row."
msgstr ""
"Dieselbe Stellung kam dreimal vor, deshalb hat jeder Spieler die Bohnen "
"seiner eigenen Reihe genommen."

#: src/ui/window.vala:704
msgid ""
"A hundred moves went by without a capture, so each player took the seeds in "
"their own row."
msgstr ""
"Hundert Züge vergingen ohne Eroberung, deshalb hat jeder Spieler die Bohnen "
"seiner eigenen Reihe genommen."

#: src/ui/window.vala:707
msgid ""
"You could not feed the computer, so you took the seeds left on the board."
msgstr ""
"Du konntest den Computer nicht versorgen, deshalb bekommst du die restlichen "
"Bohnen auf dem Brett."

#: src/ui/window.vala:709
msgid ""
"The computer could not feed you, so it took the seeds left on the board."
msgstr ""
"Der Computer konnte dich nicht versorgen, deshalb bekommt er die restlichen "
"Bohnen auf dem Brett."

#: src/ui/window.vala:711
msgid "There was no legal move left to play."
msgstr "Es war kein gültiger Zug mehr übrig."

#~ msgid "win"
#~ msgstr "Sieg"

#~ msgid "loss"
#~ msgstr "Verlust"

#~ msgid "Worth %s seeds."
#~ msgstr "%s Bohnen wert."
